OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who dumped asbestos waste
OL,4,A'could face jail'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman running a waste removal
OL,7,Fbusiness has admitted to dumping a
OL,8,F600kg pile of waste that included
OL,9,Fasbestos roofing sheets in a rural
OL,10,Fvillage.
OL,12,FCharlotte Bulmer, who traded as Swindon
OL,13,FWaste Removal, appeared at Salisbury
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on 24 November and
OL,15,Fpleaded guilty to three offences under
OL,16,Fthe Environmental Protection Act 1990.
OL,18,FWiltshire Council said its
OL,19,Fenvironmental enforcement team began an
OL,20,Finvestigation in January after the
OL,21,Fwaste was reported in Etchilhampton.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
